#
# Conformance case: common-logic/conjunction.
#
# ISO 24707 (Common Logic) example — a conjunction of two ground predications:
#   CLIF:  (and (Cat Yojo) (On Yojo Mat))
# "Yojo is a cat and Yojo is on the mat." Encoded as the canonical logic: full-FOL
# Formula AST (an And of a unary atom and a binary atom over constant terms). Gates the
# CLIF/CGIF/XCL Exact projections: IR round-trip isomorphism + cross-dialect equivalence.

